  "title": "The Crucial Role of Unique Identifiers: Why Every Business Needs Them Today",
  "summary": "In an era where data drives decisions, accuracy is king. Yet many businesses unintentionally invite chaos by failing to assign a proper, unique identifier (ID) to the key objects in their systems—such as orders, products, customers, or invoices. The result? Fuzzy matching errors, reconciliation nightmares, and a spike in hidden costs.Below is a deeper look at why IDs matter, what happens when you ignore them, and how you can get started implementing them effectively.1. The Cost of Poor or Missin",
